？’服曰：‘今京师岂有所任乎？’承曰：‘长水校尉种辑、议郎吴硕，是我腹心办事者。’遂定计。”","attribution":"《献帝起居注》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-76002ddfdc53c4d46244","start":0,"end":159}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
